					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO 11390 Dragon Ball Shenron &amp; Goku Icons November 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Two all-new 18+ LEGO Icons sets are now officially available for purchase at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124;</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku-sets-now-officially-released-to-general-public-free-gwp-gift-with-purchase-promo/">LEGO Venetian Neighborhood and Dragon Ball: Shenron &#038; Goku Sets Now Officially Released to General Public (Free GWP Gift with Purchase Promo)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Two all-new 18+ LEGO Icons sets are now officially available for purchase at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). These include 11388 Venetian Neighborhood and 11390 Dragon Ball: Shenron &amp; Goku. Insiders got early access to purchase the set from November 1-3, 2026 while the official release date is on November 4, 2026.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="848" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113610 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png" alt="" width="1200" height="675" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-300x169.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-768x432.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113620 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="797" height="778" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x293.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x999.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x749.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113021 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113035 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="831" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 831w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-208x300.png 208w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-709x1024.png 709w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x1109.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 831px) 100vw, 831px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>There are also several LEGO gift with purchases GWP promotions going on as well. One of the more notable ones include LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set that&#8217;s FREE with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD purchase at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This offer runs from October 28 to November 8, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113737 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="739" height="860" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 739px) 100vw, 739px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113742 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="751" height="874" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 751px) 100vw, 751px" /></p>
<p>The other gift with purchase is the 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP gift set. This gift set is FREE when you purchase the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Promotion runs until November 8, 2026 or while supplies last. Yes, you&#8217;ll get  <strong>two FREE LEGO gift with purchases</strong> (40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP and 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP) when you buy the Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113621 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="905" height="760" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-1024x860.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-768x645.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 905px) 100vw, 905px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113625 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="944" height="791" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-1024x858.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-768x644.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 944px) 100vw, 944px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>As a friendly reminder, there are are still a large selection of LEGO sets retiring soon at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). <strong>See What&#8217;s Retiring Soon at the Official LEGO Site over here:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that there&#8217;s still a good selection of LEGO sets discounted as well. <strong>See LEGO Sales &amp; Deals List:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks as we regularly update and inform all of our readers of the latest LEGO Promotions, GWP and Sales &amp; Deals.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO November 2026 Promotions &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>November 1-8, 2026 (Worldwide):</strong> Free LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (Worldwide): </strong>Free LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD LEGO purchase</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30685 TIE Interceptor Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Harry Potter 30724 Dumbledore&#8217;s Office with <span style="text-decoration: underline;">SELECTED</span> LEGO Harry Potter purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (UK only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30727 TIE Advanced Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than £35 GBP</li>
<li><strong>Until November 20, 2026 (Australia only):</strong> Free 18+ LEGO 40768 Star Trek Type-15 Shuttlepod GWP with purchase of the 18+ LEGO Icons Star Trek U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D 10356 set</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
