										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96579 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="928" height="720" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 928w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x233.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76452-Quality-Quidditch-Supplies-Ice-Cream-Parlour-June-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x596.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 928px) 100vw, 928px" /></p>
